| Task | Arm | # | Outcome | Checks | Tokens | Time | Rounds | Run id |
|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|
| \`hello\` | Direct | 1 | failed | 0 of 1 | 1,000 | 2.0 s | - | \`direct.hello.1.x\` |
| \`hello\` | Direct | 2 | passed | 1 of 1 | 1,100 | 4.0 s | - | \`direct.hello.2.x\` |
| \`hello\` | Ralph Loop | 1 | passed | 1 of 1 | 1,000 | 2.0 s | 1 | \`ralph-loop.hello.1.x\` |
| \`hello\` | Ralph Loop | 2 | failed | 0 of 1 | 1,100 | 4.0 s | 2 | \`ralph-loop.hello.2.x\` |
| \`hello\` | Reflexion | 1 | passed | 1 of 1 | 1,000 | 2.0 s | 1 | \`reflexion.hello.1.x\` |
| \`hello\` | Reflexion | 2 | passed | 1 of 1 | 1,100 | 4.0 s | 2 | \`reflexion.hello.2.x\` |
| \`hello\` | Execute & Evaluate | 1 | passed | 1 of 1 | 1,000 | 2.0 s | 1 | \`exec-eval.hello.1.x\` |
| \`hello\` | Execute & Evaluate | 2 | passed | 1 of 1 | 1,100 | 4.0 s | 2 | \`exec-eval.hello.2.x\` |
| \`bye\` | Ralph Loop | 1 | failed | 0 of 1 | 1,000 | 2.0 s | 1 | \`ralph-loop.bye.1.x\` |
| \`bye\` | Ralph Loop | 2 | did not start: scripted does not answer | 0 of 1 | 1,100 | 4.0 s | - | - |
| \`bye\` | Reflexion | 1 | passed | 1 of 1 | 1,000 | 2.0 s | 1 | \`reflexion.bye.1.x\` |
| \`bye\` | Reflexion | 2 | inconclusive | 0 of 1 | 1,100 | 4.0 s | 2 | \`reflexion.bye.2.x\` |
| \`bye\` | Execute & Evaluate | 1 | passed | 1 of 1 | 1,000 | 2.0 s | 1 | \`exec-eval.bye.1.x\` |

</details>

A topology run's step records are in \`runs/<run id>/steps.json\`, with \`record.json\` beside them, in the layout \`jig run\` keeps. The direct arm's prompt, reply, what was written and the checks' results are in \`runs/<run id>/direct.json\`. \`jig replay\` reads a run only from \`.jig/runs/\` inside the folder its \`--dir\` names, so to replay one, copy its folder there: \`mkdir -p .jig/runs && cp -R runs/<run id> .jig/runs/ && jig replay <run id>\`.

Report drawn 2026-11-19T12:00:00.000Z from 13 recorded attempts.
"
